@PromotionService_HostAddress = http://localhost:6207
@internalKey = dev-only-internal-key-change-me

### Validate mã FREESHIP - áp dụng được (seed sẵn trong migration)
POST {{PromotionService_HostAddress}}/api/promotion/validate
Content-Type: application/json
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}

{
  "code": "FREESHIP",
  "customerId": "8f14e45f-ea1c-4f2e-9b3d-77c0d5a1b201",
  "orderAmount": 65400
}

### Validate mã chưa đạt giá trị tối thiểu -> valid=false (vẫn 200)
POST {{PromotionService_HostAddress}}/api/promotion/validate
Content-Type: application/json
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}

{
  "code": "FREESHIP",
  "customerId": "8f14e45f-ea1c-4f2e-9b3d-77c0d5a1b201",
  "orderAmount": 10000
}

### Reserve mã FREESHIP cho một orderId (gọi lại cùng orderId sẽ idempotent)
POST {{PromotionService_HostAddress}}/api/promotion/reserve
Content-Type: application/json
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}

{
  "code": "FREESHIP",
  "customerId": "8f14e45f-ea1c-4f2e-9b3d-77c0d5a1b201",
  "orderId": "b1d9a6c4-3e57-4f80-9a2c-1e6f4b8d0c33",
  "orderAmount": 65400
}

### Commit reservation (thay {{reservationId}} bằng kết quả reserve ở trên)
POST {{PromotionService_HostAddress}}/api/promotion/reservations/{{reservationId}}/commit
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}

### Release reservation
POST {{PromotionService_HostAddress}}/api/promotion/reservations/{{reservationId}}/release
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}

### Health
GET {{PromotionService_HostAddress}}/health/live

###
GET {{PromotionService_HostAddress}}/health/ready
